# Other matches:     python3 pipeline/supplement/match_nypl.py --source <name>, then coverage_report.py --source <name>
# supplement_all.csv (about 37 MB): python3 pipeline/supplement/build_supplement.py  (reads the other files here; keeps reviewer verdicts)
*.csv
# Local map data: python3 pipeline/supplement/build_map_data.py
*.geojson

# Review list: python3 pipeline/supplement/review_recommendations.py (keeps verdicts); review_queue_local.csv stays local.
